<title>SINGAPORE: Dumai refinery to start maintenance February 22.</title>
<headline>Dumai refinery to start maintenance February 22.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's state-owned Pertamina is to start a scheduled 38-day maintenance shut down at its 120,000 barrels-per-day (bpd) Dumai refinery on Saturday, industry sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>As reported previously, the refinery plans a complete shutdown to carry out maintenance work that had originally been scheduled for last November.</p>
<p>The refinery shut down a 27,500-bpd hydrocracker earlier in February in preparation for the overall turnaround.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
